WEBVTT

cue-1
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.420
For more text formatting options,

cue-2
00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:04.760
click the

cue-3
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.780
three dots more icons in the toolbar.

cue-4
00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:11.360
You can underline and strikethrough text

cue-5
00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:14.820
and make subscripts and superscripts.

cue-6
00:00:16.079 --> 00:00:19.060
Remember to avoid overusing underlined
text,

cue-7
00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:21.740
as it can be confused with links.

cue-8
00:00:23.260 --> 00:00:25.920
To create lists, headings, and block
quotes,

cue-9
00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:27.220
click the

cue-10
00:00:27.940 --> 00:00:31.080
format dropdown and select your desired
format.

cue-11
00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:37.220
The list and heading formats open
additional toolbar options when selected.

cue-12
00:00:38.860 --> 00:00:42.240
Use a list format for bulleted or numbered
items.

cue-13
00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:47.780
You can use these to additionally adjust
your list and headings.

cue-14
00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:53.900
For accessibility, remember to use a
heading format for section headers

cue-15
00:00:54.560 --> 00:00:57.940
and avoid using simply bold or italicized
text.

cue-16
00:00:59.380 --> 00:01:03.600
At the end of paragraph toolbar are the
undo and redo buttons,

cue-17
00:01:04.519 --> 00:01:09.480
which allow you to undo and redo changes
that you make within this paragraph block.
